WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.230
The storm had passed. For the first time, the sun was rising over the Broken Isles.

2
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:11.350
In the hall beneath the fortress, 18 capsules are still sleeping. All in Sila's hands.

3
00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:16.290
We have to wake them. But how? The fortress is guarded on every side.

4
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:23.250
I know an old route. A forgotten tunnel through the crystal mines.

5
00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:27.280
A tunnel? Another tunnel? We're always going into tunnels in this show.

6
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.330
Eray's joke made everyone laugh. But Leon's face was serious.

7
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:38.890
I see a code in my dreams. One, two, three. Like the key to a door.

8
00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:43.290
Leon might be right. These numbers are the order the capsules open in.

9
00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:47.930
At midday, the team set off toward the crystal mines.

10
00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.770
Sergeant was in front again.

11
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.980
Sergeant, don't go too far. It's dangerous here.

12
00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:58.090
Deep in the mine, blue crystals were glowing like heartbeats.

13
00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:03.330
It's like these crystals know us. Their light is turning toward us.

14
00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:07.190
Be careful, Mony. Nothing here is what it seems.

15
00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:11.270
At the end of the tunnel, a giant wall of ice blocked their way.

16
00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:15.350
Great. Now ice. Doesn't anyone have fire power?

17
00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.120
No need for fire. This is my job.

18
00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.370
Mira placed her hands on the ice and, for the first time, used the other side of her power.

19
00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:27.150
I don't just freeze things. I can melt them too.

20
00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:34.090
The ice wall melted like a waterfall, and before them appeared the giant hall of 18 capsules.

21
00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:38.210
Here they are. They've waited for hundreds of years.

22
00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:42.950
We have to be quick. Sila's guards check the hall every hour.

23
00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:47.400
Following the order from his dream, Leon touched the panel of the first capsule.

24
00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:51.230
One, two, three. Now.

25
00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:56.450
The lids of three capsules opened at once. A cold mist filled the hall.

26
00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:00.190
Heartbeats are normal. Three new people are waking up.

27
00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:02.950
We did it. Leon, you did it.

28
00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:08.510
But their joy didn't last long. The hall lights suddenly turned red.

29
00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:12.680
How touching. You opened my capsules for me.

30
00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:17.770
They're not yours, Sila. They're humanity's last hope.

31
00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:21.950
Hope? Hope is only as much as I allow.

32
00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:24.330
Guard robots filled the hall.

33
00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:27.870
The team formed a circle to protect the three who had woken.

34
00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:30.730
Everyone behind me. I'm freezing the corridor.

35
00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:36.070
Mira's ice stopped the robots. Mony's shield sealed the door.

36
00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:38.610
The shield is holding. Come on, now!

37
00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:41.660
The exit is here. Sergeant found the way again.

38
00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:45.710
The team fled back to the mine with the three who had woken.

39
00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:52.350
Three of them. Fifteen capsules left. But now we have a way.

40
00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:56.870
And a key. My memory is coming back, AyShe.

41
00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:01.730
But in the emptied hall, something stirred inside the fourth capsule.

42
00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:04.490
Behind the glass, two red eyes opened.

43
00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:08.070
And someone on the team was secretly whispering the plan to Sila.

